      "System.Description": "<p><b>Context:</b> The confirmation email today lists totals only; customers opening expense claims ask support for the VAT split (~30 tickets/month tagged &quot;vat&quot;). The order API already returns per-item VAT rates and amounts (GET /orders/{id}), so this is email-template rendering only. </p><p><b>Reason:</b> Recurring, quantified support demand; no backend change needed — order data is complete. </p><p><b>Scope:</b> This story adds the VAT breakdown table to the confirmation email template. Out of scope: invoice PDF (separate story), credit notes. </p>",
      "System.History": "Note: legal confirmed there is no mandated VAT layout for transactional email; the template team's standard table is fine.",
